# Synthetic, privacy-safe manual-QA sample audio (see manual-qa/samples/README.md)
!/manual-qa/samples/audio/normal_lesson.wav
# M12 Round 3 QA-spec fix (m01-02): same audio content as normal_lesson.wav
# under a distinct filename, so the SRT/VTT-equivalence test no longer
# collides with the product's intentional duplicate-file-path invariant.
!/manual-qa/samples/audio/normal_lesson2.wav

